                        <node id="QuestState">
                            <attribute id="Achievement" value="" type="22" />
                            <attribute id="Act" value="0" type="4" />
                            <attribute id="Description" value="We opened a sarcophagus, freeing a strange, ancient being that called itself an Eternal. She seemed to be quite dismayed to lay eyes on us, as we bear the likeness of &apos;the Seven lords&apos;. The being noted that our gods must have won their conflict with her kind after they sealed her in this place, and remarked that we, their creations, seem to be little more than &apos;Source Vats&apos;. Just what is this &apos;Eternal&apos;? And what does she mean...?" handle="h5701fcecg85b6g4990gbf88g480668d6aca8" type="28" />
                            <attribute id="DevComment" value="" type="22" />
