                        <node id="QuestState">
                            <attribute id="Achievement" value="" type="22" />
                            <attribute id="Act" value="0" type="4" />
                            <attribute id="Description" value="My journey into the heart of the Nameless Isle was fraught with danger - the forces of Void did everything in their power to prevent any Godwoken from ascending to grasp the powers of the gods. Try as I did to resist them, I found myself sworn in a Covenant with their supreme overlord, the God King. I was now bound to him, but I continued on my original path nonetheless. Ultimately, I made my way into the first part of the Council - the Academy." handle="h619ff4dag3bd4g41cdg96c6gc442feb943c6" type="28" />
                            <attribute id="DevComment" value="" type="22" />
