                        <node id="QuestState">
                            <attribute id="Achievement" value="" type="22" />
                            <attribute id="Act" value="0" type="4" />
                            <attribute id="Description" value="Malady appeared aboard the Lady Vengeance and rescued me. Once more, we retreated into the Hall of Echoes. The Council of Seven was lost, our plans were in disarray, while Dallis had thwarted our efforts by purging the Wellspring.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;I remained bound to the will of the God King, but perhaps if I could reclaim the powers from Dallis, I could still defeat him. But why did Dallis seize the powers in the first place? Was she a fellow agent of the Void? Did she think her actions were somehow righteous? Or was it a simple lust for power?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Only the Hammer herself could answer such questions. Malady believed that Dallis would likely make her way to Arx, where the remains of Lucian were interred. If she had plans for the powers of the Divine, then they likely involved the last person to wield them.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;And so the Lady Vengeance cut a path through the Hall of Echoes, setting a course for Arx. I enjoyed the respite while I could, for I sensed that the end was drawing near." handle="hd799b770ga28bg4f9cg93f8gd7a76f2711e1" type="28" />
                            <attribute id="DevComment" value="" type="22" />
                            <attribute id="Gain" value="0" type="4" />
